# M3 刷写（前端 → rpcd → flash.uc）
msgid "Flash firmware"
msgstr "刷写固件"

msgid "Target version"
msgstr "目标版本"

msgid "Target build id"
msgstr "目标构建"

msgid "Image file"
msgstr "镜像文件"

msgid "Image size"
msgstr "镜像体积"

msgid "This cannot be undone"
msgstr "此操作不可逆"

msgid "Flashing reboots the router: the network drops until it is back, and everything written to /tmp is lost. Existing configuration is kept, because sysupgrade runs with -c -k."
msgstr "刷写会重启设备：重启期间断网，/tmp 里的内容全部丢失。系统刷写用 -c -k 执行，因此现有配置会保留。"

msgid "I confirm: flash this image and reboot the router."
msgstr "我确认：刷写这个镜像并重启设备。"

msgid "Allow cross-distribution flashing"
msgstr "允许跨发行版刷写"

msgid "Cross-distribution flashing"
msgstr "跨发行版刷写"

msgid "Flash now"
msgstr "立即刷写"

msgid "The command is: %s"
msgstr "将执行命令：%s"

msgid "No blocking problem found so far."
msgstr "目前没有发现阻断问题。"

msgid "Flashing is blocked"
msgstr "刷写被阻断"

msgid "Flashing is blocked: fix the problems listed above."
msgstr "刷写被阻断：请先解决上面列出的问题。"

msgid "Flashing failed: "
msgstr "刷写失败："

msgid "A flash is already pending. Reboot the router and let the boot check confirm it first."
msgstr "已有一笔刷写待重启确认。请先重启设备，让开机检查确认结果。"

msgid "Run a check first: nothing tells which image this device should be flashed with."
msgstr "请先做一次检测：现在没有任何依据能确定该刷哪个镜像。"

msgid "The image has not been downloaded and verified yet."
msgstr "镜像还没有下载并通过校验。"

msgid "This source belongs to a different distribution. Tick the cross-distribution override first."
msgstr "该源属于另一个发行版。请先勾选跨发行版放行。"

msgid "Waiting for reboot confirmation"
msgstr "等待重启确认"

msgid "The image was written and sysupgrade was started. The state is confirmed after the router reboots."
msgstr "镜像已写入、刷写已发起。设备重启后才会确认这次刷写的结果。"

msgid "Flash confirmed after reboot"
msgstr "重启后已确认刷写成功"

msgid "The build id after reboot matches the target: %s"
msgstr "重启后的构建标识与目标一致：%s"

msgid "Flash not confirmed"
msgstr "刷写未被确认"

msgid "After reboot the build id is %s while the target was %s."
msgstr "重启后的构建标识是 %s，而目标是 %s。"

msgid "Clear flash state"
msgstr "清除刷写状态"

msgid "Flash state cleared."
msgstr "刷写状态已清除。"
